{"data":{"body":"[P2] `digest_for` converts every lookup failure into an empty value, and the later equality considers two empty values equal. Concurrent transient failures for `latest` and the newest version can therefore make verification pass without proving either digest exists. Propagate lookup failures and explicitly reject empty or `None` digests before comparing them.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7xbjxS","finding_digest":"8c570c6c02f5e74120ae7f7cf42b185350abaae6131d6849e389273c3037f0fa","finding_id":"arf_v1_rrlqy3ac6xtucifop56pikyykn","finding_key":"github/workflows/ecr-release.yml::publish_verified::digest-errors-must-not-pass","identity_key":"github/workflows/ecr-release.yml::publish_verified::digest-errors-must-not-pass","line":356,"observation_digest":"0cf579a0a6c3b9b56aec94ccb7ca784c14dca70a970114a3f13e4ec733466384","observation_id":"aro_v1_bt2xtifgyo43k2xmstglpstyjq","path":".github/workflows/ecr-release.yml","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-18T20:40:42Z","review_id":"arr_v1_bpxfxexaatevgcwo2rieenbphl","reviewed_base_sha":"2f530ee07e76a0bb90cdb303c583977308e78de4","reviewed_head_sha":"edaee67dd29442aca338074a3b3a7b6632e1d959","reviewer":"codex","start_line":351,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":718},"record_id":"art_v1_uxjnvzooa3cbks7fsn4hjyr2d6","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-18T20:40:42Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
